// SRD 5.1 spell (docs/dnd.srd.5.1/07_Spells). Points default to the level; cantrips are free.
// Non-consumed SRD components are dropped (PRD §8.3); consumed ones go in `components`.
// `effect` is the shape of what the spell does; the numbers are rule slots in data/rules/casting.ron.
// Durations are party-clock minutes: a fight round is one minute, so the SRD's "1 minute" is 10.
// The hand opens or closes the first door up to six tiles straight ahead, the crawler's one object.
(schema: 1, id: "base:spell:mage_hand", name: "base:text:spell.mage_hand.name", level: 0, school: Conjuration, classes: ["base:class:wizard"], concentration: false, ritual: false, description: "base:text:spell.mage_hand.description", effect: Some(Utility(OpenDoor(range_tiles: 6))), reach: One)
